{"description":"std-analytics-collector \u2014 the collector std-analytics reports to. A beacon (`{ n, d, u, r?, w?, p? }` JSON: event name, site, path, referrer, screen width, properties) arrives at the inbound hook analytics (/api/hooks/analytics) and is stored as an AnalyticsEvent whose visitorId is the SHA-256 of the day's salt, the client IP (the first x-forwarded-for address), the user agent and the site: stable within one UTC day, never reversible, and the IP itself is never stored. One random salt per UTC day lives in an AnalyticsSalt row created on the day's first beacon. The hook answers 202 for a stored beacon, 400 for one that is not a JSON object with a non-empty name, site and path (or whose site the domains knob does not list) and 500 when the store fails. ANALYTICS_STATS answers the pageviews, unique visitors and the top pages, countries and referrer hosts of a site and time window.","inbound":["analytics"],"ledger":{"entries":{"ent_BED3KJ4HRG8W8D3AVZ2XVRD71Z":{"bakedName":"AnalyticsSalt","curName":"AnalyticsSalt","id":"ent_BED3KJ4HRG8W8D3AVZ2XVRD71Z","kind":"entity","owner":"workspace","renames":[]},"ent_K8JEBGQ2SHHCRS4VJ74PY9RMWX":{"bakedName":"AnalyticsEvent","curName":"AnalyticsEvent","id":"ent_K8JEBGQ2SHHCRS4VJ74PY9RMWX","kind":"entity","owner":"workspace","renames":[]},"ent_N753Z682MD1A6SJCXC78FF0TZ1":{"bakedName":"AnalyticsCollector","curName":"AnalyticsCollector","id":"ent_N753Z682MD1A6SJCXC78FF0TZ1","kind":"entity","owner":"workspace","renames":[]},"evt_1QWAQQRW6BE35TDKPEPF6HZ5HC":{"bakedName":"EVENT_UNRECORDED","curName":"EVENT_UNRECORDED","id":"evt_1QWAQQRW6BE35TDKPEPF6HZ5HC","kind":"event","owner":"workspace","parent":"trt_1M960BAEQ37BHKD9GP61KMJ7MC","renames":[]},"evt_8TTKZ73V0JXG93EEZ5QJQK5S55":{"bakedName":"STATS_LOADED","curName":"STATS_LOADED","id":"evt_8TTKZ73V0JXG93EEZ5QJQK5S55","kind":"event","owner":"workspace","parent":"trt_MTYMYJ008M04A6VZBYPS0R4K7D","renames":[]},"evt_96EMYJYYPEFB78ZHKST1D8VXV4":{"bakedName":"SALT_READY","curN